  "descriptionMarkdown": "This blueprint is to help you rebuild the main base in mission 1 of greenflag Story Missions mod. Takes care of everything, but you will need to manually craft a few items.\n\nTo be able to research the tank, you will need 350 military  and chemical science packs (as well as many more of automation et logistic science packs). You can find in the map 300 military science pack and 275 chemical science packs.\n\nTo make the missing 50 military pack, you will need 25 piercing rounds, 25 grenades and 50 walls, which are easy to manually craft and feed the chest next to the assembling machine (walls can be gathered from around the map without needing to craft them for this). For the missing 75 chemical science packs, you will need 38 sulfur, 113 advanced circuits and 75 engines, but this one is automated.",
